  "body": "The strict tangency's fold annulus on coarse meshes reads over the scallop tolerance (hill 0.126-0.154, tilted shelf 0.170 vs 0.123); a kernel decision. The verdict is non-blocking and ratcheted, so the program verifies with a named warning.\r\n\r\nDone means: generators meet their tolerance on these fixtures, ratchet tightened.\r\n\r\nSource: ROADMAP.md M13.9; RECOMMENDED.md \"M13.9: the scallop law lives\"\r\n",
